{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18572","headline":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇 · 柳宗元","name":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奔鲸沛，荡海垠。\n吐霓翳日，腥浮云。\n帝怒下顾，哀垫昏。\n授以神柄，推元臣。\n手援天矛，截修鳞。\n披攘蒙霿，开海门。\n地平水静，浮天根。\n羲和显耀，乘清氛。\n赫炎溥畅，融大钧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}